  RootNode:
    dialogueText: '3rd March

      

      Today I went to the pong looking for
      flies but there was a crowd of frogs there. I approached to find they were
      all staring at something. When I looked out at the pond I saw a log, the log
      was still in the water, so serene, so peaceful.

      

      5th March

      

      All
      the frogs have had a meeting. We decided we all really like the log and wish
      we could make him king.'
